    <briefdescription>
<para>Renders a miniature preview of the loaded patent model into a RenderTexture and displays the result in the UI as a Sprite. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Triggered when entering StateMachine.States.MODEL_VIEW_STATE and reset on QR scan. Requires a Camera component inside the loaded model&apos;s hierarchy. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
